                             "h":  "Welcome to SS3 Physics",
                             "p":  [
                                       "This term you study how energy changes form and how it is sent from where it is made to where it is used, how machines make work easier and how they are kept in good condition, how dams make electricity, and how rockets and satellites work. You will also study two Nigerian satellites, NigeriaSat-1 and NigComSat-1, and see how Physics helps national development.",
                                       "Work through the units in order. Try every calculation yourself before reading the answer. At the end of each unit are practice questions; they do not count towards a mark but help you check your understanding."
